WEBVTT


1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Photos were a struggle
on my old phone.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.700
We were in Thumamah.
The weather was beautiful.

3
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:07.000
My photos weren’t clear.

4
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.100
With iPhone, the detail, everything—
it makes me happy.

5
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.900
Photography became my life.

6
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:14.000
I’m Tahani. I switched to iPhone.
